# Kars for WebCLAP

Kars by DISTRHO (a Karplus-Strong plucked string synthesizer, based on karplong by Chris Cannam), ported to WebCLAP. This is not an official DISTRHO release.

- Kars: https://github.com/DISTRHO/Kars (commit 769b1a3, ISC)
- [DPF](https://github.com/DISTRHO/DPF) (commit 4238e1c), the DISTRHO Plugin Framework the plugin is written with
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-kars.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here.

## License

The bundle as a whole is licensed under the **ISC license** (`LICENSE`).

Kars is under the ISC license (`licenses/Kars-ISC.txt`), as is DPF (`licenses/DPF-ISC.txt`); both permit this
combination. The bundle's `LICENSE` is Kars' ISC license.

The bundle holds the DSP only (`module.wasm`): DPF's own CLAP wrapper compiled to WebAssembly. The plugin's graphical
editor is not part of it, hosts show the plugin's parameters instead.

